  "ability": {
    "name": "Inferno Blast",
    "description": "Unleash a blast of fire that deals 20 damage to a single target."
  }
}
```

This algorithm generates unique magic abilities for characters in Aethoria, considering rank, limitations, and costs to ensure balanced and diverse abilities. The algorithm is flexible enough to generate a wide variety of magic abilities while maintaining consistency within the world of Aethoria.
